return ['domain'=>NULL,'plural-forms'=>'nplurals=1; plural=0;','language'=>'uz_UZ','project-id-version'=>'Babilim 1.1.0','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-11-01T01:09:17+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-11-01T01:09:17+00:00','x-generator'=>'Babilim','messages'=>['Babilim'=>'Babilim','Fills in missing translations for the plugins and themes already installed on your site.'=>'Saytingizda o\'rnatilgan plaginlar va mavzular uchun yetishmayotgan tarjimalarni to\'ldiradi.','Translations'=>'Tarjimalar','Babilim Settings'=>'Babilim sozlamalari','Settings'=>'Sozlamalar','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Sizga bu amalni bajarishga ruxsat berilmagan.','Select fewer components: at most %1$d operations per run (you selected %2$d).'=>'Kamroq komponent tanlang: har bir ishga ko\'pi bilan %1$d ta amal (siz %2$d ta tanladingiz).','That component is not installed on this site, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Bu komponent ushbu saytda o\'rnatilmagan, shuning uchun u uchun tarjima so\'rab bo\'lmaydi.','Already installed.'=>'Allaqachon o\'rnatilgan.','Downloaded and installed.'=>'Yuklab olindi va o\'rnatildi.','Babilim has not been enabled for this site yet.'=>'Babilim bu sayt uchun hali yoqilmagan.','No build is available to download for this locale.'=>'Bu til uchun yuklab olish mumkin bo\'lgan yig\'ilma yo\'q.','Rolled back to the previous build.'=>'Oldingi buildga qaytarildi.','Rolled back and reported.'=>'Qaytarildi va xabar berildi.','Rolled back, but the report could not be sent: %s'=>'Qaytarildi, lekin xabarni yuborib bo\'lmadi: %s','Removed.'=>'Olib tashlandi.','Translation requested.'=>'Tarjima so\'raldi.','This component was already uploaded. Babilim is checking it now.'=>'Bu komponent allaqachon yuklangan. Babilim uni hozir tekshirmoqda.','Upload cancelled.'=>'Yuklash bekor qilindi.','Upload complete — translation requested.'=>'Yuklash yakunlandi — tarjima so\'raldi.','This component does not declare a version number, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Bu komponent versiya raqamini ko\'rsatmagan, shuning uchun u uchun tarjima so\'rab bo\'lmaydi.','This component\'s version number is longer than %d characters, which Babilim cannot handle, so a translation cannot be requested for it.'=>'Bu komponentning versiya raqami %d belgidan uzun, Babilim buni qayta ishlay olmaydi, shuning uchun u uchun tarjima so\'rab bo\'lmaydi.','A translation cannot be requested for that locale on this site right now.'=>'Hozir bu saytda ushbu til uchun tarjima so\'rab bo\'lmaydi.','Thank you. Your report was sent.'=>'Rahmat. Xabaringiz yuborildi.','This report does not name a valid plugin or theme and locale.'=>'Bu xabarda to\'g\'ri plagin yoki mavzu va til ko\'rsatilmagan.','Please choose a category for this report.'=>'Iltimos, bu xabar uchun turkumni tanlang.','This report is missing a valid build to report against.'=>'Bu hisobotda hisobot berish uchun yaroqli build yo\'q.','This build is not one this site currently knows about for this component/locale.'=>'Bu build ushbu sayt uchun ushbu komponent/mahalliy til bo\'yicha hozir ma\'lum emas.','The field "%1$s" is too long: it has %2$d characters and the limit is %3$d. Nothing was sent; please shorten it and try again.'=>'"%1$s" maydoni juda uzun: u %2$d belgidan iborat, chegara esa %3$d. Hech narsa yuborilmadi; iltimos, uni qisqartirib, qayta urinib ko\'ring.','Original string'=>'Asl satr','String context'=>'Satr konteksti','Current translation'=>'Joriy tarjima','Suggested translation'=>'Taklif etilgan tarjima','Note (optional)'=>'Izoh (ixtiyoriy)','Where you saw this (optional)'=>'Buni qayerda ko\'rdingiz (ixtiyoriy)','Babilim sync is temporarily delayed by the service (rate limited); it will try again after %s.'=>'Babilim sinxronlash jarayoni xizmat tomonidan vaqtincha kechiktirildi (so\'rovlar chastotasi cheklangan); %s dan keyin qayta urinib ko\'riladi.','That is not a valid WordPress locale code. Nothing was saved.'=>'Bu yaroqli WordPress mahalliy til kodi emas. Hech narsa saqlanmadi.','Settings saved.'=>'Sozlamalar saqlandi.','If this is on, uninstalling also erases this site\'s identity. The paid license attached to this site cannot be restored automatically afterwards; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s to get it back.'=>'Agar bu yoqilgan bo\'lsa, o\'chirishda ushbu saytning identifikatori ham o\'chiriladi. Ushbu saytga biriktirilgan pullik litsenziyani keyin avtomatik tiklab bo\'lmaydi; uni qaytarish uchun %s manzilida Babilim yordami bilan bog\'lanishingiz kerak bo\'ladi.','Babilim is set to erase this site\'s identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to this site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in the Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Babilim plagin o\'chirilganda ushbu saytning identifikatorini o\'chirishga sozlangan. Ushbu saytga biriktirilgan pullik litsenziyani keyin avtomatik tiklab bo\'lmaydi; %s manzilida Babilim yordami bilan bog\'lanishingiz kerak bo\'ladi. Identifikatorni saqlab qolish uchun Bekor qilish tugmasini bosing, Babilim sozlamalarida "O\'chirishda Babilimning barcha ma\'lumotlarini o\'chirish" belgisini olib tashlang va plaginni yana faolsizlantiring. Baribir faolsizlantirilsinmi?','%1$d site on this network is set to erase its Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to that site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %2$s. To keep the identity, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in that site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Ushbu tarmoqdagi %1$d ta sayt plagin o\'chirilganda o\'z Babilim identifikatorini o\'chirishga sozlangan. Bunday saytlarga biriktirilgan pullik litsenziyani keyin avtomatik tiklab bo\'lmaydi; %2$s manzilida Babilim yordami bilan bog\'lanishingiz kerak bo\'ladi. Identifikatorlarni saqlab qolish uchun Bekor qilish tugmasini bosing, tegishli har bir saytning Babilim sozlamalarida "O\'chirishda Babilimning barcha ma\'lumotlarini o\'chirish" belgisini olib tashlang va plaginni yana faolsizlantiring. Baribir faolsizlantirilsinmi?','This network has too many sites to check them one by one, and some of them may be set to erase their Babilim identity when the plugin is deleted. The paid license attached to such a site could then not be restored automatically; you would have to contact Babilim support at %s. To keep the identities, press Cancel, untick "Delete all Babilim data on uninstall" in each site\'s Babilim settings, and deactivate again. Deactivate anyway?'=>'Bu tarmoqda saytlar juda ko\'p, ularni birma-bir tekshirib bo\'lmaydi va ba\'zilari plagin o\'chirilganda Babilim identifikatorini o\'chirishga sozlangan bo\'lishi mumkin. Bunday saytga biriktirilgan pullik litsenziyani keyin avtomatik tiklab bo\'lmaydi; %s manzilida Babilim yordami bilan bog\'lanishingiz kerak bo\'ladi. Identifikatorlarni saqlab qolish uchun Bekor qilish tugmasini bosing, har bir saytning Babilim sozlamalarida "O\'chirishda Babilimning barcha ma\'lumotlarini o\'chirish" belgisini olib tashlang va plaginni yana faolsizlantiring. Baribir faolsizlantirilsinmi?','Open Babilim settings'=>'Babilim sozlamalarini ochish','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed.'=>'Babilim bu saytni tasdiqlay olmadi, shuning uchun hech narsa yuklab olinmaydi yoki o\'rnatilmaydi.','The service could not reach your site. A firewall, security plugin or host rule is probably blocking the request; please allow requests to /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge.'=>'Xizmat saytingizga ulana olmadi. Ehtimol, xavfsizlik devori, xavfsizlik plagini yoki hosting qoidasi so\'rovni to\'sib qo\'ymoqda; iltimos, /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge manziliga so\'rovlarga ruxsat bering.','Your site took too long to answer. Please try again later, and check that your host is not too slow or overloaded.'=>'Saytingizning javob berishi juda uzoq vaqt oldi. Iltimos, keyinroq qayta urinib ko\'ring va hostingingiz juda sekin yoki haddan tashqari band emasligini tekshiring.','Your site answered, but not with what was expected. The REST API may be rewritten by another plugin, or that endpoint may be cached; please exclude /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge from caching and rewriting.'=>'Saytingiz javob berdi, lekin kutilgan javob bilan emas. REST API boshqa plagin tomonidan o\'zgartirilgan bo\'lishi yoki bu endpoint keshlangan bo\'lishi mumkin; iltimos, /wp-json/babilim/v1/challenge manzilini keshlash va qayta yozishdan chiqarib qo\'ying.','Please check that your site can be reached from the internet, then try again.'=>'Iltimos, saytingizga internetdan kirish mumkinligini tekshiring va qayta urinib ko\'ring.','Re-verify'=>'Qayta tasdiqlash','This site is over the size the service accepts in one sync, so some items were left out: %1$d components and %2$d locales.'=>'Bu sayt xizmat bir sinxronlashda qabul qiladigan hajmdan oshib ketgan, shuning uchun ba\'zi elementlar qoldirildi: %1$d ta komponent va %2$d ta til.','This site is verified.'=>'Bu sayt tasdiqlangan.','Registration restarted.'=>'Ro\'yxatdan o\'tish qayta boshlandi.','Sync complete.'=>'Sinxronlash yakunlandi.','Babilim is enabling and checking this site… Reload this page or wait for the scheduled check to finish.'=>'Babilim bu saytni yoqmoqda va tekshirmoqda… Bu sahifani qayta yuklang yoki rejalashtirilgan tekshiruv tugashini kuting.','Babilim could not finish enabling (%1$s): %2$s'=>'Babilim yoqishni yakunlay olmadi (%1$s): %2$s','A host that serves only one PHP request at a time cannot complete this step.'=>'Bir vaqtning o\'zida faqat bitta PHP so\'rovini bajaradigan hosting bu bosqichni yakunlay olmaydi.','Babilim is enabled: this site is verified and %d component was found.'=>'Babilim yoqilgan: bu sayt tasdiqlangan va %d ta komponent topildi.','Babilim is disabled. Nothing more is sent; translations already installed keep working.'=>'Babilim o\'chirilgan. Boshqa hech narsa yuborilmaydi; allaqachon o\'rnatilgan tarjimalar ishlashda davom etadi.','Supplementary translation index rebuilt.'=>'Qo\'shimcha tarjimalar indeksi qayta qurildi.','Sweep complete: %d file deleted.'=>'Skanerlash yakunlandi: %d ta fayl o\'chirildi.','Removed %d installed component.'=>'%d ta o\'rnatilgan komponent olib tashlandi.','Automatic installs are now off; turn them on again in the settings if you want them.'=>'Avtomatik o\'rnatish endi o\'chirilgan; xohlasangiz, sozlamalarda uni qayta yoqing.','Babilim finds the plugins and themes on this site that have no translation for your language and installs one for each.'=>'Babilim bu saytdagi tilingiz uchun tarjimasi yo\'q plaginlar va mavzularni topadi hamda ularning har biriga tarjima o\'rnatadi.','Languages found on this site: %s.'=>'Bu saytda topilgan tillar: %s.','The free plan covers a limited number of plugins and themes; your exact quota is shown in Settings after you enable Babilim.'=>'Bepul tarif cheklangan miqdordagi plagin va mavzularni qamrab oladi; aniq kvotangiz Babilim\'ni yoqqaningizdan keyin Sozlamalarda ko\'rsatiladi.','What is sent when you enable Babilim'=>'Babilim\'ni yoqqaningizda nima yuboriladi','Enabling…'=>'Yoqilmoqda…','Enable Babilim'=>'Babilim\'ni yoqish','By clicking Enable, you agree to send the information listed above to Babilim.'=>'Yoqish tugmasini bosish orqali yuqorida sanab o\'tilgan ma\'lumotlarni Babilimga yuborishga rozilik bildirasiz.','Check again now'=>'Hozir qayta tekshirish','Babilim installed %d translation automatically since your last visit.'=>'Oxirgi tashrifingizdan beri Babilim %d ta tarjimani avtomatik o\'rnatdi.','Babilim is enabling and checking this site… (last attempt: %s)'=>'Babilim bu saytni yoqmoqda va tekshirmoqda… (oxirgi urinish: %s)','Check again'=>'Qayta tekshirish','No components synced yet.'=>'Hali hech qanday komponent sinxronlanmagan.','%d succeeded'=>'%d ta muvaffaqi