 site already has an active registration that can no longer be recovered automatically.'=>'Bu saytda faol ro\'yxatdan o\'tish mavjud, uni endi avtomatik tiklab bo\'lmaydi.','Restart registration'=>'Ro\'yxatdan o\'tkazishni qayta boshlash','Babilim settings'=>'Babilim sozlamalari','General'=>'Umumiy','Advanced'=>'Qo\'shimcha','Languages'=>'Tillar','Automatic installs'=>'Avtomatik o\'rnatishlar','Install available translations automatically'=>'Mavjud tarjimalarni avtomatik o\'rnatish','This site is part of a multisite network, which does not install new translations automatically. Translations that are already installed are still updated.'=>'Bu sayt ko\'p saytli tarmoqning bir qismi bo\'lib, yangi tarjimalarni avtomatik o\'rnatmaydi. Allaqachon o\'rnatilgan tarjimalar baribir yangilanadi.','Custom overrides'=>'Maxsus o\'zgartirishlar','Keep my own translation overrides when purging everything or uninstalling this plugin.'=>'Hammasini tozalashda yoki ushbu plaginni o\'chirishda mening tarjima o\'zgartirishlarimni saqlash.','Translation files you put in %s always take priority over Babilim\'s. They are kept unless you uncheck this.'=>'%s papkasiga joylagan tarjima fayllaringiz doim Babilim fayllaridan ustun turadi. Ular siz belgini olib tashlamaguningizcha saqlanadi.','Uninstall'=>'O\'chirish','Delete all Babilim data on uninstall'=>'O\'chirishda Babilimning barcha ma\'lumotlarini o\'chirish','Off by default: deleting the plugin keeps this site\'s identity, so a reinstall can reuse it.'=>'Odatda o\'chirilgan: plaginni o\'chirish bu saytning identifikatorini saqlab qoladi, shuning uchun qayta o\'rnatishda undan foydalanish mumkin.','Account'=>'Hisob','Save changes'=>'O\'zgarishlarni saqlash','Disable Babilim'=>'Babilim\'ni o\'chirish','Installed translations are kept, but no further checks or downloads will run.'=>'O\'rnatilgan tarjimalar saqlanadi, lekin boshqa tekshiruvlar va yuklab olishlar bajarilmaydi.','Disable Babilim? Installed translations are kept, but no further checks or downloads will run.'=>'Babilim\'ni o\'chirasizmi? O\'rnatilgan tarjimalar saqlanadi, lekin boshqa tekshiruvlar va yuklab olishlar bajarilmaydi.','This site is not registered with Babilim yet.'=>'Bu sayt hali Babilim\'da ro\'yxatdan o\'tmagan.','This site is already licensed. Reload the page.'=>'Bu saytga allaqachon litsenziya berilgan. Sahifani qayta yuklang.','Checkout is not available for this site right now.'=>'Hozirda bu sayt uchun to\'lov mavjud emas.','Could not start checkout: %s'=>'To\'lovni boshlab bo\'lmadi: %s','Babilim is not enabled.'=>'Babilim yoqilmagan.','Not registered yet'=>'Hali ro\'yxatdan o\'tmagan','Not verified'=>'Tasdiqlanmagan','Verified'=>'Tasdiqlangan','Status'=>'Holati','Licensed'=>'Litsenziyalangan','Partner'=>'Hamkor','Free'=>'Bepul','License'=>'Litsenziya','Upgrade this site'=>'Ushbu saytni yangilash','One-time purchase for this site: %1$s %2$s. Includes all future translation updates. Payment is handled by Paddle in a new tab.'=>'Ushbu sayt uchun bir martalik xarid: %1$s %2$s. Barcha kelgusi tarjima yangilanishlarini o\'z ichiga oladi. To\'lovni Paddle yangi yorliqda amalga oshiradi.','This issues a new restore code and the previous one stops working. Continue?'=>'Bu yangi tiklash kodini beradi va avvalgisi ishlamay qoladi. Davom etasizmi?','Show a new restore code'=>'Yangi tiklash kodini ko\'rsatish','rc_…'=>'rc_…','Restore code'=>'Tiklash kodi','Restore purchase'=>'Xaridni tiklash','Bought a license for this domain before? Enter the restore code you received at checkout.'=>'Bu domen uchun avval litsenziya sotib olganmisiz? To\'lov vaqtida olgan tiklash kodingizni kiriting.','That does not look like a restore code.'=>'Bu tiklash kodiga o\'xshamaydi.','This restore code was not recognised for this site.'=>'Bu tiklash kodi ushbu sayt uchun tanilmadi.','Too many attempts. Try again tomorrow.'=>'Juda ko\'p urinish. Ertaga qayta urinib ko\'ring.','This site must be verified first.'=>'Avval ushbu sayt tasdiqlanishi kerak.','Could not restore the purchase: %s'=>'Xaridni tiklab bo\'lmadi: %s','Purchase restored. This site is now licensed.'=>'Xarid tiklandi. Endi bu sayt litsenziyalangan.','This site has no purchase to show a code for.'=>'Bu saytda kod ko\'rsatiladigan xarid yo\'q.','Could not show a new restore code: %s'=>'Yangi tiklash kodini ko\'rsatib bo\'lmadi: %s','Your new restore code: %s. Keep it somewhere safe — the previous code no longer works.'=>'Yangi tiklash kodingiz: %s. Uni xavfsiz joyda saqlang — avvalgi kod endi ishlamaydi.','What is sent when Babilim checks this site'=>'Babilim bu saytni tekshirganda nima yuboriladi','(detected)'=>'(aniqlangan)','No language is managed yet.'=>'Hozircha birorta til boshqarilmaydi.','Babilim adds translations for every language checked here.'=>'Babilim bu yerda belgilangan har bir til uchun tarjimalar qo\'shadi.','Add another language'=>'Yana til qo\'shish','Choose a language…'=>'Tilni tanlang…','Could not load the full WordPress.org locale list from the service, so no other language can be added right now.'=>'Xizmatdan WordPress.org lokallarining to\'liq ro\'yxatini yuklab bo\'lmadi, shuning uchun hozir boshqa til qo\'shib bo\'lmaydi.','Theme'=>'Mavzu','Plugin'=>'Plagin','Free quota'=>'Bepul kvota','Downloads: %1$d/%2$d (%3$s)'=>'Yuklab olishlar: %1$d/%2$d (%3$s)','Supplementary translation index'=>'Qo\'shimcha tarjimalar indeksi','Built'=>'Yaratilgan','Included'=>'Kiritilgan','Excluded'=>'Chiqarib tashlangan','Already in WordPress core'=>'WordPress yadrosida allaqachon mavjud','Supplementary translation maintenance'=>'Qo\'shimcha tarjimalarga xizmat ko\'rsatish','Maintenance status is not available right now.'=>'Xizmat ko\'rsatish holati hozir mavjud emas.','A cleanup was paused on %1$s: %2$s. Nothing was deleted.'=>'Tozalash %1$s da to\'xtatildi: %2$s. Hech narsa o\'chirilmadi.','Last cleanup on %1$s: %2$d newly marked, %3$d file(s) deleted, %4$d record(s) removed.'=>'So\'nggi tozalash %1$s da: %2$d yangi belgilandi, %3$d fayl o\'chiril