lash davom etmoqda — davom ettiring yoki bekor qiling','Scheduled, waiting to be processed'=>'Rejalashtirilgan, qayta ishlashni kutmoqda','Translating…'=>'Tarjima qilinmoqda…','Translation failed'=>'Tarjima muvaffaqiyatsiz tugadi','Free quota used'=>'Bepul kvota ishlatilgan','Needs a paid license'=>'Pullik litsenziya kerak','Not supported'=>'Qo\'llab-quvvatlanmaydi','Status unknown'=>'Holat noma\'lum','translation statusInstalled'=>'O\'rnatilgan','Update available'=>'Yangilanish mavjud','Removed after a failed integrity check'=>'Yaxlitlikni tekshirish muvaffaqiyatsiz tugagani sababli olib tashlandi','Installed · built for %s, new version scheduled'=>'O\'rnatilgan · %s uchun yaratilgan, yangi versiya rejalashtirilgan','Installed · built for a different version, new version scheduled'=>'O\'rnatilgan · boshqa versiya uchun yaratilgan, yangi versiya rejalashtirilgan','Installed · built for %s, translating the new version…'=>'O\'rnatilgan · %s uchun yaratilgan, yangi versiya tarjima qilinmoqda…','Installed · built for a different version, translating the new version…'=>'O\'rnatilgan · boshqa versiya uchun yaratilgan, yangi versiya tarjima qilinmoqda…','Installed · built for %1$s, this site has %2$s'=>'O\'rnatilgan · %1$s uchun yaratilgan, bu saytda %2$s mavjud','Installed · built for %s'=>'O\'rnatilgan · %s uchun yaratilgan','Installed · built for a different version'=>'O\'rnatilgan · boshqa versiya uchun yaratilgan','Installed · built for %s, new version failed'=>'O\'rnatilgan · %s uchun tuzilgan, yangi versiya muvaffaqiyatsiz','Installed · built for a different version, new version failed'=>'O\'rnatilgan · boshqa versiya uchun tuzilgan, yangi versiya muvaffaqiyatsiz','Installed · built for %s, new version needs a paid license'=>'O\'rnatilgan · %s uchun tayyorlangan, yangi versiya pullik litsenziyani talab qiladi','Installed · built for a different version, new version needs a paid license'=>'O\'rnatilgan · boshqa versiya uchun tayyorlangan, yangi versiya pullik litsenziyani talab qiladi','Installed · built for %s, free quota used'=>'O\'rnatilgan · %s uchun tayyorlangan, bepul kvota ishlatib bo\'lingan','Installed · built for a different version, free quota used'=>'O\'rnatilgan · boshqa versiya uchun tayyorlangan, bepul kvota ishlatib bo\'lingan','translation statusAvailable'=>'Mavjud','Installed · %s'=>'O\'rnatilgan · %s','Available · %s'=>'Mavjud · %s','Update'=>'Yangilash','Download'=>'Yuklab olish','Updating…'=>'Yangilanmoqda…','Downloading…'=>'Yuklab olinmoqda…','Retry request'=>'So\'rovni qayta yuborish','Request newer translation'=>'Yangiroq tarjimani so\'rash','Request translation'=>'Tarjimani so\'rash','Requesting…'=>'So\'ralmoqda…','Requesting a translation uses one of your free slots, unless this component already uses one. A failed translation does not give the slot back.'=>'Tarjima so\'rash bo\'sh o\'rinlaringizdan birini sarflaydi, agar bu komponent allaqachon birini ishlatmayotgan bo\'lsa. Muvaffaqiyatsiz tarjima o\'rinni qaytarmaydi.','If this component does not use one of your free slots yet, requesting a translation uses one. A failed translation does not give the slot back. Continue?'=>'Agar bu komponent hali bo\'sh o\'rinlaringizdan birini ishlatmagan bo\'lsa, tarjima so\'rash birini sarflaydi. Muvaffaqiyatsiz tarjima o\'rinni qaytarmaydi. Davom etilsinmi?','No plugins or themes found.'=>'Hech qanday plagin yoki mavzu topilmadi.','Clear filters'=>'Filtrlarni tozalash','No components match these filters. %s'=>'Bu filtrlarga mos komponent yo\'q. %s','Select all'=>'Hammasini tanlash','All'=>'Barchasi','Available'=>'Mavjud','Updates'=>'Yangilanishlar','Requestable'=>'So\'rash mumkin','Installed'=>'O\'rnatilgan','Plugins'=>'Plaginlar','Themes'=>'Mavzular','All languages'=>'Barcha tillar','%d to install'=>'%d ta o\'rnatishga tayyor','Language:'=>'Til:','Bulk actions apply to every matching language of each selected component.'=>'Ommaviy amallar tanlangan har bir komponentning mos keladigan barcha tillariga qo\'llaniladi.','Bulk actions apply only to the selected language of each selected component.'=>'Ommaviy amallar tanlangan har bir komponentning faqat tanlangan tiliga qo\'llaniladi.','Version %s'=>'Versiya %s','Theme · %s'=>'Mavzu · %s','Plugin · %s'=>'Plagin · %s','Remove the %2$s translation of %1$s from this site?'=>'%1$s komponentining %2$s tilidagi tarjimasi bu saytdan olib tashlansinmi?','Roll back the %2$s translation of %1$s to the previous build?'=>'%1$s komponentining %2$s tilidagi tarjimasi oldingi buildga qaytarilsinmi?','%1$s: %2$s'=>'%1$s: %2$s','%1$s: %2$s (%3$s)'=>'%1$s: %2$s (%3$s)','The registration challenge is not in the expected form.'=>'Ro\'yxatdan o\'tish uchun tekshiruv topshirig\'i kutilgan shaklda emas.','That is not a valid build identifier.'=>'Bu yaroqli build identifikatori emas.','Refusing to write outside the Babilim language-file directory.'=>'Babilim til fayllari katalogidan tashqariga yozishni rad etdim.','Could not write the downloaded package to disk.'=>'Yuklab olingan paketni diskka yozib bo\'lmadi.','Unexpected HTTP %d response.'=>'Kutilmagan HTTP %d javobi.','This site\'s URL, so the service can verify you own it.'=>'Ushbu saytning URL manzili, shunda xizmat sizga tegishli ekanini tekshira oladi.','Your WordPress version, to serve compatible translation files.'=>'Mos tarjima fayllarini yetkazib berish uchun WordPress versiyangiz.','Your PHP version, for compatibility.'=>'PHP versiyangiz, moslik uchun.','This plugin\'s own version, so the service can tell you to update it if it\'s too old to talk to.'=>'Ushbu plaginning o\'z versiyasi, shunda u juda eski bo\'lib, xizmat bilan aloqa qila olmasa, xizmat uni yangilashni aytishi mumkin.','This site\'s configured locale.'=>'Ushbu saytning sozlangan lokali.','Every locale in use on this site (site locale, installed language packs, user locales, and any you add manually). No locale is treated differently from another.'=>'Ushbu saytda ishlatilayotgan barcha lokallar (sayt lokali, o\'rnatilgan til paketlari, foydalanuvchi lokallari va qo\'lda qo\'shganlaringiz). Barcha lokallarga bir xil munosabatda bo\'linadi.','(a public key generated for this site)'=>'(ushbu sayt uchun yaratilgan ochiq kalit)','This site\'s install public key, used to prove requests genuinely come from this site. Only the public half is ever sent.'=>'Ushbu saytning o\'rnatish ochiq kaliti, so\'rovlar haqiqatan ham shu saytdan kelganini isbotlash uchun ishlatiladi. Faqat ochiq qismi yuboriladi.','Every installed plugin/theme: its slug, version, text domain(s), whether it\'s a wp.org listing, its own bundled locales, and which locales you\'ve already installed a Babilim translation for.'=>'O\'rnatilgan har bir plagin/mavzu: uning slugi, versiyasi, matn domen(lar)i, wp.org ro\'yxatida bor-yo\'qligi, o\'zi bilan kelgan tillar va qaysi tillar uchun Babilim tarjimasini allaqachon o\'rnatganingiz.','(generic codes and coordinates only)'=>'(faqat umumiy kodlar va koordinatalar)','Up to 20 pending diagnostic events (e.g. a file that failed its integrity check), each just a code, component, and locale, and never any string content or translated text.'=>'Kutilayotgan 20 tagacha diagnostika hodisasi (masalan, yaxlitlikni tekshirishdan o\'tmagan fayl haqidagi hodisa). Har biri faqat kod, komponent va lokaldan iborat bo\'lib, hech qachon satrlar mazmuni yoki tarjima matnini o\'z ichiga olmaydi.','Unsafe locale: %s'=>'Xavfli lokal: %s','Manifest unavailable: %s'=>'Manifest mavjud emas: %s','Could not determine active components; the existing merged index was left unchanged.'=>'Faol komponentlarni aniqlab bo\'lmadi; mavjud birlashtirilgan indeks o\'zgartirilmadi.','Could not determine installed plugins/themes; sweep skipped, nothing was deleted.'=>'O\'rnatilgan plagin/mavzularni aniqlab bo\'lmadi; tozalash o\'tkazib yuborildi, hech narsa o\'chirilmadi.','Sweep aborted without orphaning anything: %s.'=>'Tozalash hech narsani egasiz qoldirmasdan bekor qilindi: %s.','The cleanup ran, but some of its changes could not be recorded in the translation index; the next cleanup will retry them.'=>'Tozalash bajarildi, lekin ba\'zi o\'zgarishlarni tarjimalar indeksida qayd etib bo\'lmadi; keyingi tozalashda ularni qayd etishga yana uriniladi.','component kind in the sweep brake messagetheme'=>'mavzu','component kind in the sweep brake messageplugin'=>'plagin','it would orphan every managed %1$s component (%2$d of %2$d)'=>'u boshqariladigan barcha %1$s komponentlarini egasiz qoldiradi (%2$d tadan %2$d tasi)','it would orphan %1$d of %2$d managed components (more than half)'=>'u boshqariladigan %2$d ta komponentdan %1$d tasini egasiz qoldiradi (yarmidan ko\'proq)','The merged index for \'%s\' was rebuilt, but the translation index could not record it; the next rebuild will retry.'=>'\'%s\' uchun birlashtirilgan indeks qayta qurildi, lekin tarjimalar indeksi uni qayd eta olmadi; keyingi qayta qurish yana urinadi.','Could not write the staged merged index.'=>'Bosqichma-bosqich birlashtirilgan indeksni yozib bo\'lmadi.','Re-parsed entry count did not match the built index.'=>'Qayta tahlil qilingan yozuvlar soni tuzilgan indeksga mos kelmadi.','Could not move the merged index for \'%s\' into place; the previous served index (if any) was removed rather than left half-updated. No default-domain supplement is served for this locale until the next successful rebuild.'=>'\'%s\' uchun birlashtirilgan indeksni joyiga ko\'chirib bo\'lmadi; oldingi xizmat ko\'rsatilgan indeks (agar bo\'lsa) yarim yangilangan holda qoldirilmay, o\'chirildi. Keyingi muvaffaqiyatli qayta qurishgacha bu til uchun standart domen qo\'shimchasi taqdim etilmaydi.','Could not open zip: %s'=>'zip faylni ochib bo\'lmadi: %s','Zip has no manifest.json.'=>'Zip ichida manifest.json yo\'q.','manifest.json in the zip is not valid JSON.'=>'zip ichidagi manifest.json yaroqli JSON emas.','manifest.json\'s \'%s\' does not match the expected value.'=>'manifest.json dagi \'%s\' kutilgan qiymatga mos kelmaydi.','Another installation is running; try again in a moment.'=>'Boshqa o\'rnatish jarayoni ishlamoqda; birozdan so\'ng qayta urinib ko\'ring.','Not a valid server_build_id: %s'=>'Yaroqli server_build_id emas: %s','The package manifest\'s kind \'%1$s\' does not match the requested kind \'%2$s\'.'=>'Paket manifestidagi \'%1$s\' turi so\'ralgan \'%2$s\' turiga mos kelmaydi.','The package\'s text domain \'%1$s\' does not match this site\'s copy of the component (\'%2$s\'), so it was not installed.'=>'Paketning matn domeni \'%1$s\' ushbu saytdagi komponent nusxasining (\'%2$s\') matn domeniga mos kelmaydi, shuning uchun o\'rnatilmadi.','The given domain \'%1$s\' matches neither the package manifest\'s own slug \'%2$s\' nor its text_domain \'%3$s\'.'=>'Berilgan \'%1$s\' domeni paket manifestidagi \'%2$s\' slugiga ham, \'%3$s\' text_domain qiymatiga ham mos kelmaydi.','Unsafe slug: %s'=>'Xavfli slug: %s','Unsafe text_domain: %s'=>'Xavfli text_domain: %s','The package has no %s for its own text domain.'=>'Paketda o\'zining matn domeni uchun %s yo\'q.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'manifest.json da \'%s\' yo\'q yoki yaroqsiz.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'entries\'.'=>'manifest.json da \'entries\' yo\'q yoki yaroqsiz.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'files\'.'=>'manifest.json da \'files\' yo\'q yoki yaroqsiz.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'extra_domains\'.'=>'manifest.json mavjud emas yoki \'extra_domains\' yaroqsiz.','manifest.json is missing or has an invalid \'build_no\'.'=>'manifest.json mavjud emas yoki \'build_no\' yaroqsiz.','manifest.json\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'manifest.json faylidagi \'server_build_id\' yaroqli build identifikatori emas.','manifest.json\'s \'contract\' is not a valid version string.'=>'manifest.json faylidagi \'contract\' yaroqli versiya qatori emas.','manifest.json\'s \'status\' must be \'published\'.'=>'manifest.json faylidagi \'status\' qiymati \'published\' bo\'lishi kerak.','manifest.json\'s \'kind\' must be \'plugin\' or \'theme\'.'=>'manifest.json faylidagi \'kind\' qiymati \'plugin\' yoki \'theme\' bo\'lishi kerak.','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_entries\'.'=>'manifest.json faylida yaroqsiz \'default_domain_entries\' bor.','manifest.json has an invalid \'default_domain_files\'.'=>'manifest.json faylida yaroqsiz \'default_domain_files\' bor.','expected_manifest is missing or has an invalid \'%s\'.'=>'expected_manifest mavjud emas yoki \'%s\' yaroqsiz.','expected_manifest\'s \'server_build_id\' is not a valid build id.'=>'expected_manifest ichidagi \'server_build_id\' yaroqli build identifikatori emas.','No record for %s'=>'%s uchun yozuv yo‘q','One or more served files no longer match the manifest.'=>'Bir yoki bir nechta berilgan fayl endi manifest bilan mos kelmaydi.','No previous build to roll back to.'=>'Orqaga qaytariladigan oldingi build yo\'q.','The change could not be recorded in the translation index; please try again.'=>'O\'zgarish tarjimalar indeksiga yozilmadi; qayta urinib ko\'ring.','Unknown kind: %s'=>'Noma’lum tur: %s','Unsafe domain: %s'=>'Xavfli domen: %s','The text domain \'%1$s\' (%2$s) is already served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was installed.'=>'\'%1$s\' matn domeni (%2$s) boshqa o\'rnatilgan komponent (%3$s) uchun allaqachon taqdim etilgan; hech narsa o\'rnatilmadi.','Rolling back would overwrite \'%1$s\' (%2$s), which is now served for another installed component (%3$s); nothing was changed.'=>'Orqaga qaytarish \'%1$s\' (%2$s) faylini ustidan yozadi, u hozir boshqa o‘rnatilgan komponent (%3$s) uchun xizmat qilmoqda; hech narsa o‘zgartirilmadi.','Zip is missing expected file: %s'=>'Zip arxivda kutilgan fayl yo‘q: %s','sha256 mismatch for %s'=>'%s uchun sha256 mos kelmadi','The package declares no main translation file.'=>'Paketda asosiy tarjima fayli ko‘rsatilmagan.','Zip is missing expected default file: %s'=>'Zip arxivda kutilgan standart fayl yo‘q: %s','sha256 mismatch for default/%s'=>'default/%s uchun sha256 mos kelmadi','Could not stage %s'=>'%s faylini tayyorlab bo‘lmadi','Could not stage default/%s'=>'default/%s faylini tayyorlab bo‘lmadi','Entry count mismatch for %s'=>'%s uchun yozuvlar soni mos kelmadi','Could not verify entry count for %s'=>'%s uchun yozuvlar sonini tekshirib bo‘lmadi','l10n.php entry count mismatch for %s'=>'%s uchun l10n.php yozuvlari soni mos kelmadi','Default supplement entry count mismatch.'=>'Standart qo‘shimchadagi yozuvlar soni mos kelmadi.','The package produced no servable main translation file.'=>'Paket xizmat ko‘rsatish mumkin bo‘lgan asosiy tarjima faylini yaratmadi.','Could not prepare %s for rollback.'=>'%s ni orqaga qaytarishga tayyorlab bo\'lmadi.','Could not back up %s before replacing it.'=>'%s almashtirilishidan oldin uning zaxira nusxasini yaratib bo‘lmadi.','Could not move %s into place.'=>'%s faylini joyiga ko‘chirib bo‘lmadi.','Could not read %s back after moving it into place.'=>'%s joyiga ko\'chirilgandan so\'ng uni qayta o\'qib bo\'lmadi.','English (United States)'=>'Ingliz tili (Amerika Qo‘shma Shtatlari)','Babilim_Manifest is unavailable: %s'=>'Babilim_Manifest mavjud emas: %s','could not read _manifest.json: %s'=>'_manifest.json faylini o‘qib bo‘lmadi: %s','failed to parse _manifest.json: %s'=>'_manifest.json faylini tahlil qilib bo‘lmadi: %s','_manifest.json has an unexpected structure'=>'_manifest.json kutilmagan tuzilishga ega','Could not create the package archive.'=>'Paket arxivini yaratib bo‘lmadi.','A file in the component could not be read, so it was not packaged.'=>'Komponentdagi bitta faylni o‘qib bo‘lmadi, shuning uchun u paketga kiritilmadi.','Only plugins and themes can be packaged.'=>'Faqat plaginlar va mavzularni paketlash mumkin.','The component\'s main file was not found.'=>'Komponentning asosiy fayli topilmadi.','The component is not inside the plugins or themes directory.'=>'Komponent plaginlar yoki mavzular katalogi ichida emas.','Babilim ran out of time for this step and will continue on the next check.'=>'Babilim bu qadam uchun ajratilgan vaqtdan oshib ketdi va keyingi tekshiruvda davom etadi.','Babilim could not verify this site, so nothing is downloaded or installed until verification succeeds.'=>'Babilim bu saytni tasdiqlay olmadi, shuning uchun tasdiqlash muvaffaqiyatli bo‘lmaguncha hech narsa yuklab olinmaydi yoki o‘rnatilmaydi.','Registration response was missing required fields.'=>'Ro‘yxatdan o‘tkazish javobida zarur maydonlar yetishmadi.','No pending challenge to verify.'=>'Tasdiqlash uchun kutilayotgan chaqiriq yo‘q.','Verify response was missing site_token.'=>'Tasdiqlash javobida site_token yetishmadi.','Rotate-token response was missing site_token.'=>'Tokenni almashtirish javobida site_token yetishmadi.','nonce must be a hexadecimal string.'=>'nonce o\'n oltilik satr bo\'lishi kerak.','No pending challenge for this nonce.'=>'Bu nonce uchun kutilayotgan so\'rov yo\'q.','Too many requests.'=>'Juda ko‘p so‘rovlar.','The service asked this site to wait before syncing again.'=>'Xizmat bu saytdan qayta sinxronlashdan oldin kutishni so\'radi.','This site has %1$d components across %2$d languages, which needs %3$d check batches; Babilim can handle at most %4$d per run. Reduce the managed languages in Settings or deactivate unused plugins and themes, then press Check again now.'=>'Bu saytda %2$d ta tilda %1$d ta komponent bor, buning uchun %3$d ta tekshiruv to‘plami kerak; Babilim har bir ishga tushirishda ko‘pi bilan %4$d tasini bajara oladi. Sozlamalarda boshqariladigan tillarni kamaytiring yoki ishlatilmayotgan plaginlar va mavzularni faolsizlantiring, so‘ng Hozir qayta tekshirish tugmasini bosing.','Babilim could not finish checking this site.'=>'Babilim bu saytni tekshirishni yakunlay olmadi.','This site\'s address is too long for Babilim to register.'=>'Bu saytning manzili Babilim ro‘yxatdan o‘tkazishi uchun juda uzun.','This site\'s locale code is not one Babilim can register.'=>'Bu saytning mahalliy til kodi Babilim ro\'yxatdan o\'tkaza oladigan kod emas.','The download response was missing a usable location.'=>'Yuklab olish javobida foydalanish mumkin bo‘lgan manzil yo‘q edi.','The service\'s upload offer was incomplete.'=>'Xizmatning yuklash taklifi to‘liq emas edi.','This component is larger than the service accepts, so it cannot be uploaded.'=>'Bu komponent xizmat qabul qiladigan hajmdan katta, shuning uchun uni yuklab bo‘lmaydi.','The packaged component could not be read.'=>'Paketlangan komponentni o‘qib bo‘lmadi.','A part of the upload kept failing, so the upload was cancelled.'=>'Yuklashning bir qismi qayta-qayta muvaffaqiyatsiz bo‘ldi, shuning uchun yuklash bekor qilindi.','Could not read: %s'=>'O‘qib bo‘lmadi: %s','No site id is on file to rotate a token for.'=>'Tokenni almashtirish uchun fayllarda saqlangan sayt identifikatori yo‘q.','Original language'=>'Asl til','This report will be posted publicly on GitHub and may be kept by third parties.'=>'Ushbu hisobot GitHub’da ochiq e’lon qilinadi va uchinchi tomonlar tomonidan saqlanishi mumkin.','Share this report'=>'Ushbu hisobotni ulashish','Always share'=>'Doimo ulashish','Don\'t share'=>'Ulashmaslik','Error reports'=>'Xatolik hisobotlari','Share error reports'=>'Xatolik hisobotlarini ulashish','%d report is waiting. "Always share" and "Don\'t share" apply to all of them.'=>'%d ta hisobot kutmoqda. “Doimo ulashish” va “Ulashmaslik” ularning barchasiga tatbiq etiladi.','Report translation'=>'Tarjima haqida xabar berish','Search the installed translations'=>'O‘rnatilgan tarjimalarni qidirish','Search'=>'Qidirish','Babilim has not installed any translation for this language.'=>'Babilim bu til uchun hech qanday tarjima o‘rnatmagan.','No installed translation matches.'=>'Mos keladigan o‘rnatilgan tarjima topilmadi.','The search could not be completed.'=>'Qidiruvni yakunlab bo‘lmadi.','Choose'=>'Tanlash','Preview'=>'Oldindan ko\'rish','These fields will be sent:'=>'Quyidagi maydonlar yuboriladi:','Close'=>'Yopish','This string can\'t be reported from this site.'=>'Bu satr haqida ushbu saytdan xabar berib bo‘lmaydi.','Too many reports today. Try again tomorrow.'=>'Bugun hisobotlar juda ko‘p. Ertaga qayta urinib ko‘ring.','The report could not be sent.'=>'Hisobotni yuborib bo‘lmadi.','Type'=>'Turi','Build'=>'Build','Babilim hit an error. Share an error report?'=>'Babilim xatolikka duch keldi. Xatolik hisobotini ulashasizmi?','When something fails inside Babilim, send an error report to the Babilim service so it can be published as a public issue on GitHub. The report is sent as coming from this site, with the same authentication as every other request to the Babilim service. The service publishes only the error code and versions as a public issue on GitHub; the public issue contains no site address, content or file paths. Off by default.'=>'Babilim ichida biror narsa ishdan chiqqanda, uni GitHub’da ommaviy muammo sifatida e’lon qilish uchun Babilim xizmatiga xatolik hisobotini yuboring. Hisobot ushbu saytdan kelgandek yuboriladi va Babilim xizmatiga yuboriladigan boshqa barcha so‘rovlar bilan bir xil autentifikatsiyadan foydalanadi. Xizmat GitHub’da ommaviy muammo sifatida faqat xatolik kodi va versiyalarni e’lon qiladi; ommaviy muammoda sayt manzili, kontent yoki fayl yo‘llari bo‘lmaydi. Sukut bo‘yicha o‘chirilgan.','Your report is processed automatically by AI models and may improve this translation for other sites.'=>'Hisobotingiz AI modellari tomonidan avtomatik qayta ishlanadi va boshqa saytlar uchun ushbu tarjimani yaxshilashi mumkin.','Type at least 2 characters to search.'=>'Qidirish uchun kamida 2 ta belgi kiriting.','Available translations can be installed with one click, and missing ones can be requested. After that, new translations and updates are installed automatically. The Babilim service decides which available translations may be installed automatically. On the free plan it normally only allows plugins and themes that already have a Babilim translation installed on this site, so that automatic installs do not take up a new free slot.'=>'Mavjud tarjimalarni bir bosishda o‘rnatish mumkin, yetishmayotganlarini esa so‘rash mumkin. Shundan keyin yangi tarjimalar va yangilanishlar avtomatik o‘rnatiladi. Qaysi mavjud tarjimalar avtomatik o‘rnatilishi mumkinligini Babilim xizmati hal qiladi. Bepul tarifda u odatda faqat shu saytda Babilim tarjimasi allaqachon o‘rnatilgan plaginlar va mavzularga ruxsat beradi, shunda avtomatik o‘rnatishlar yangi bepul o‘rinni band qilmaydi.','The Babilim service decides which available translations may be installed automatically. On the free plan it normally only allows plugins and themes that already have a Babilim translation installed on this site, so that automatic installs do not take up a new free slot.'=>'Qaysi mavjud tarjimalar avtomatik o‘rnatilishi mumkinligini Babilim xizmati hal qiladi. Bepul tarifda u odatda faqat shu saytda Babilim tarjimasi allaqachon o‘rnatilgan plaginlar va mavzularga ruxsat beradi, shunda avtomatik o‘rnatishlar yangi bepul o‘rinni band qilmaydi.','This report does not name an installed string.'=>'Bu hisobotda o‘rnatilgan satr ko‘rsatilmagan.','This string is not among the translations installed on this site. Search again and pick it from the list.'=>'Bu satr ushbu saytda o‘rnatilgan tarjimalar orasida yo‘q. Qayta qidiring va uni ro‘yxatdan tanlang.','This translation was updated since you searched. Search again and pick the string from the new list.'=>'Bu tarjima siz qidirganingizdan keyin yangilangan. Qayta qidiring va satrni yangi ro‘yxatdan tanlang.','Babilim will upload these files from %1$s (version %2$s): every .php and .js file, every block.json file, and the readme.txt, readme.md, style.css and theme.json in its main folder. They are used to find the text that needs translating and to identify the plugin or theme.'=>'Babilim %1$s (versiya %2$s) uchun ushbu fayllarni yuklaydi: har bir .php va .js fayli, har bir block.json fayli hamda asosiy papkadagi readme.txt, readme.md, style.css va theme.json. Ular tarjima qilinishi kerak bo‘lgan matnni topish hamda plagin yoki mavzuni aniqlash uchun ishlatiladi.','Files with other names or extensions are not included, nor are the uploads, cache, logs, backup, data, vendor, node_modules and languages folders, hidden files, or files whose names match common secrets (wp-config*, .env*, *.sql, *.log, *.pem, *.key). Code files can still contain text or data you would not want to share; check them if you are unsure. The service removes the same kinds of files again on arrival.'=>'Boshqa nom yoki kengaytmali fayllar, shuningdek uploads, cache, logs, backup, data, vendor, node_modules va languages papkalari, yashirin fayllar hamda nomi keng tarqalgan maxfiy ma’lumotlarga mos keladigan fayllar (wp-config*, .env*, *.sql, *.log, *.pem, *.key) kiritilmaydi. Kod fayllarida baribir boshqalar bilan ulashishni xohlamaydigan matn yoki ma’lumotlar bo‘lishi mumkin; ishonchingiz komil bo‘lmasa, ularni tekshiring. Fayllar xizmatga kelib tushganda, xizmat xuddi shu turdagi fayllarni yana olib tashlaydi.','Only when you confirm an upload for a plugin or theme that is not on WordPress.org: every .php and .js file, every block.json file, and the readme.txt, readme.md, style.css and theme.json in that component\'s main folder, as a zip, after files that match common secrets are left out.'=>'Faqat WordPress.org’da mavjud bo‘lmagan plagin yoki mavzu uchun yuklashni tasdiqlaganingizda: har bir .php va .js fayli, har bir block.json fayli hamda shu komponentning asosiy papkasidagi readme.txt, readme.md, style.css va theme.json fayllari — keng tarqalgan maxfiy ma’lumotlarga mos keladigan fayllar chiqarib tashlangach, zip ko‘rinishida.','The component has no files that can be uploaded.'=>'Komponentda yuklash mumkin bo‘lgan fayllar yo‘q.','Babilim could not confirm a temporary folder outside the website, so the component was not packaged and nothing was uploaded. Define BABILIM_TEMP_DIR in wp-config.php as a writable folder outside the web root (for example a folder next to, not inside, your site\'s public directory), or ask your host for one.'=>'Babilim veb-sayt tashqarisidagi vaqtinchalik papkani tasdiqlay olmadi, shuning uchun komponent paketlanmadi va hech narsa yuklanmadi. wp-config.php faylida BABILIM_TEMP_DIR ni veb ildiz papkasidan tashqaridagi yozish mumkin bo‘lgan papka sifatida belgilang (masalan, saytingizning ommaviy katalogi ichida emas, uning yonidagi papka) yoki hosting provayderingizdan so‘rang.','Babilim was updated while this upload was waiting. The old package was discarded; please confirm the upload again.'=>'Bu yuklash kutilayotganda Babilim yangilandi. Eski paket bekor qilindi; iltimos, yuklashni qayta tasdiqlang.']];